I want to listen to music.
But the mobile phone is almost empty.
I need my charging cable.
Where is the cable?
I search in the flat.
Is it lying on the table?
No, only the laptop is lying on the table.
Is the cable lying next to the bed?
No, only my shoes are standing next to the bed.
Maybe it is lying under the chair?
No, there is nothing under the chair.
I go into the hallway.
My backpack is still standing there.
I open the backpack and search.
In the backpack is a thick winter sweater.
I lift the sweater up.
And there lies the charging cable!
It is lying in the backpack, under the sweater.
I take the cable.
Now I charge the mobile phone and listen to music.
